Output docs/menu.gif

Set Shell bash
Set FontSize 15
Set Width 1100
Set Height 640
Set Padding 24
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 70ms

Hide
Type "source docs/demo/setup.sh && source /src/docs/demo/conversations.sh"
Enter
Wait@180s /^\$$/
Show

Sleep 500ms
Type "clauder"
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 1.8s
Down
Sleep 700ms
Down
Sleep 700ms
Up
Sleep 900ms
Type "b"
Sleep 1.2s
Enter
Sleep 2s
Down
Sleep 600ms
Down
Sleep 600ms
Up
Sleep 600ms
Up
Sleep 800ms
Enter
Sleep 7s
